  "title": "Lighter Fettuccini Alfredo",
  "description": "Whip up a smooth blend of milk, Neufchatel cheese, butter, garlic powder, onion powder, minced garlic and Parmesan cheese to make a pleasingly creamy sauce for fettuccini.",
